     "description": "cam_surface_exchange.csv row (step 2, phase bc_out) and cam_phys_tend.csv row (step 2, site radiation, lev 32): the same laws at the second step (the radiation component still produces a tendency this step, so tbot is reconstructed from T + ptend_s*dt/cpair as in step 1).",
