    {
     "id": "cpslec_psl_chain_step1",
     "description": "The cpslec intermediate chain (cam_diagnostic_utils.F90:44-77) at step 1, branch 2 (Tstar > 290.5 K and TT0 > 290.5 K: alph = 0 and Tstar replaced by 0.5*(290.5 K + Tstar)): the intermediates psl_alpha/psl_tstar/psl_tt0/psl_b1/psl_b2/psl_alph/psl_tstar_final/psl_beta are Fortran-formula values (derived, not dump columns; validator replica, reproducing the dumped psl of cam_surface_exchange.csv row (step 1, bc_out)) computed from the dumped pre-radiation state (cam_phys_tend.csv row (step 1, site radiation, lev 32)); psl expected = the dumped value. All 48 window steps take branch 2; the other cpslec branches are unpinned (see README-cam.md).",
     "time_span": {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.0
     },
     "parameter_overrides": {
      "t_psl": 302.4585882010374,
      "pbot": 92152.10177120629,
      "ps": 92848.96251956573,
      "phis": 8704.816911504207
     },
     "assertions": [
      {
       "variable": "psl_alpha",
       "time": 0.0,
       "expected": 0.1902656109907259,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-12
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "psl_tstar",
       "time": 0.0,
       "expected": 302.8937662480276,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-12
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "psl_tt0",
       "time": 0.0,
       "expected": 308.6637424593863,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-12
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "psl_b1",
       "time": 0.0,
       "expected": 0.0,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-12,
        "abs": 1e-24
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "psl_b2",
       "time": 0.0,
       "expected": 1.0,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-12
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "psl_alph",
       "time": 0.0,
       "expected": 0.0,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-12,
        "abs": 1e-24
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "psl_tstar_final",
       "time": 0.0,
       "expected": 296.69688312401377,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-12
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "psl_beta",
       "time": 0.0,
       "expected": 0.1022117298886724,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-12
       }
      },
      {
       "variable": "psl",
       "time": 0.0,
       "expected": 102841.17870757317,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-12
       }
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "cpslec_flat_branch_pin",
     "description": "Branch-exercising pin (derived, not a dump column): the flat branch |phis/gravit| < 1e-4 -> psl = ps of cpslec (cam_diagnostic_utils.F90:57-59), which the 887 m SCAM column never exercises. Inputs: the step-1 dumped ps/t_psl/pbot with the branch-exercising phis = 5e-4 m^2/s^2 (|phis/gravit| = 5.1e-5 m < 1e-4). The assertion fails if the branch is missing: the exp branch would give ps*exp(beta*(1 - ...)) with beta = phis/(rair*Tstar_final) ~ 5.87e-9, i.e. psl ~ ps*(1 + 5.87e-9), a relative difference 5.9e-9 far above the 1e-12 tolerance.",
     "time_span": {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.0
     },
     "parameter_overrides": {
      "phis": 0.0005,
      "ps": 92848.96251956573,
      "t_psl": 302.4585882010374,
      "pbot": 92152.10177120629
     },
     "assertions": [
      {
       "variable": "psl",
       "time": 0.0,
       "expected": 92848.96251956573,
       "tolerance": {
        "rel": 1e-12
       }
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
